WEBVTT

00:10.051 --> 00:13.680
You're now a part of the Union,
so do as I fucking tell you, okay?

00:13.763 --> 00:15.348
Fucking answer me, okay?

00:15.432 --> 00:16.725
- Yes.
- Yes, sir.

00:16.808 --> 00:18.101
Hello, brother!

00:18.184 --> 00:19.352
Hello, sir!

00:19.436 --> 00:20.270
Hello, sir!

00:21.104 --> 00:22.856
What the fuck is this? The mafia?

00:23.815 --> 00:25.567
Don't talk to me, or I'll kill you.

00:26.484 --> 00:28.945
People will report the noise,
you dumb fucks.

00:29.029 --> 00:30.447
We're sorry, sir.

00:34.451 --> 00:36.369
Lower your fucking head.

00:39.748 --> 00:40.749
Stand up straight!

00:47.297 --> 00:48.298
Hello.

00:48.381 --> 00:49.966
- Hello.
- You're here.

01:06.107 --> 01:07.776
What the hell are you staring at?

01:09.027 --> 01:09.861
Go inside.

01:34.969 --> 01:35.804
Just a sec.

01:41.392 --> 01:42.811
I'll only say this once.

01:44.771 --> 01:45.647
Listen carefully.

01:48.358 --> 01:52.529
I don't care what Park Hu-min
and all of you are up to.

01:54.280 --> 01:56.157
And I didn't need to come here.

01:59.619 --> 02:03.289
But I came… just to make this clear.

02:08.878 --> 02:11.422
If I see you
around Su-ho's hospital again…

02:15.468 --> 02:16.678
I'll kill you all.

02:18.763 --> 02:20.557
I will kill all of you.

02:40.451 --> 02:43.163
You need to separate
the variables to solve it quickly.

02:45.206 --> 02:47.917
A fixed range variable
is no different from a constant.

02:48.001 --> 02:50.587
MATHEMATICS

02:55.300 --> 02:56.426
Keep your word…

02:58.928 --> 03:00.471
and no one will get hurt.

03:05.101 --> 03:06.978
Stop hanging around Hu-min.

03:10.315 --> 03:11.191
Fine.

03:12.859 --> 03:14.152
I understand.

03:16.279 --> 03:17.530
So keep your word too.

03:40.178 --> 03:45.350
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

04:44.492 --> 04:45.326
Hey.

04:52.792 --> 04:54.168
Don't look at me like that,

04:55.420 --> 04:56.838
or I'll gouge your eyes out.

05:14.188 --> 05:16.149
Is that fun to read?

05:25.658 --> 05:26.868
You just let him go?

05:31.998 --> 05:34.083
Then why did you tell me to bring him?

05:41.591 --> 05:42.842
Do I have to explain it?

05:50.850 --> 05:53.644
I mean, fuck,
why are you obsessed with Eunjang?

05:56.022 --> 05:58.149
It's not like they bring in much money.

05:59.817 --> 06:02.653
You know you can't outmuscle Baku.

06:03.446 --> 06:04.322
Right?

06:06.824 --> 06:08.826
So I need to make him come to me.

06:13.873 --> 06:15.708
Did our boys go to his dad's restaurant?

06:17.585 --> 06:19.629
44, 45, 46,

06:19.712 --> 06:21.631
LIFE'S TOUGH
BUT IT'S OKAY. I'M TOUGH TOO

06:21.714 --> 06:22.548
…47, 48, 49,

06:22.632 --> 06:26.469
50, 51, 52, 53, 54.

06:27.345 --> 06:30.014
DAD

06:30.723 --> 06:31.557
Five more!

06:32.225 --> 06:34.519
50, 60, 70,

06:34.602 --> 06:37.146
80, 90, 100!

06:42.735 --> 06:43.736
Yeah, Dad?

06:43.820 --> 06:45.488
Hey, Hu-min. It's Officer Han.

06:45.988 --> 06:47.657
Your dad got into trouble again.

06:47.740 --> 06:49.826
- Can you come talk to him?
- Get back here.

06:49.909 --> 06:52.829
How the fuck should I know
if it was real or fake?

06:52.912 --> 06:54.622
- Tell the truth!
- Hey, Mr. Park!

06:54.705 --> 06:56.874
- Come with me, and we'll talk.
- Hey, assholes!

06:56.958 --> 06:58.793
Come here and tell them!

06:58.876 --> 06:59.919
- I'll kill you!
- Park!

07:00.002 --> 07:01.838
- Keep those kids quiet.
- Go inside.

07:01.921 --> 07:03.297
- Why?
- Dad, stop.

07:03.881 --> 07:05.675
Come on. Please stop!

07:06.175 --> 07:07.135
You punk.

07:07.885 --> 07:09.554
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

07:09.637 --> 07:11.389
Why did you apologize, punk?

07:11.472 --> 07:13.224
I did nothing wrong! Why say sorry?

07:13.307 --> 07:14.350
Damn, please!

07:15.059 --> 07:16.936
Park. I understand.

07:17.019 --> 07:19.439
So let's go and fill out a report first.

07:19.522 --> 07:21.315
We have rules to follow.

07:21.816 --> 07:24.694
He wasn't a minor! I even checked his ID!

07:24.777 --> 07:25.903
His photo too! Damn it!

07:25.987 --> 07:27.655
Yes, so let's talk at the station.

07:27.738 --> 07:29.699
You sold alcohol to minors, didn't you?

07:29.782 --> 07:31.200
Fuck this, seriously.

07:32.034 --> 07:33.536
Fine, let's go.

07:34.203 --> 07:35.246
Let's go.

07:35.329 --> 07:37.415
Officer Kim, get the kids in the car too.

07:37.498 --> 07:38.666
Hey! Get in the car!

07:39.375 --> 07:40.668
Hey, get in. Quickly.

07:40.751 --> 07:43.004
Hey, I'm going already. Damn.

07:44.547 --> 07:48.759
Hey, Baek-jin asked me to tell you
that he misses you.

07:59.812 --> 08:03.649
NA BAEK-JIN

08:14.952 --> 08:15.786
Where are you?

08:16.954 --> 08:17.955
Let's meet tomorrow.

08:19.373 --> 08:20.500
I'll send the address.

08:35.806 --> 08:36.849
Keep your word…

08:41.354 --> 08:42.939
and no one will get hurt.

08:51.906 --> 08:53.616
Yeah, lower your stance a bit.

08:54.116 --> 08:56.953
Keep looking straight ahead. That's it.

08:57.036 --> 09:00.498
That's right. It'll become muscle memory
if you do it about a hundred times.

09:00.581 --> 09:01.457
Good!

09:01.958 --> 09:02.792
That's it.

09:05.878 --> 09:06.879
- Yeon Si-eun.
- Si-eun.

09:08.548 --> 09:11.300
What brings you here?
Are you joining our team?

09:12.343 --> 09:13.553
If you want to join,

09:13.636 --> 09:15.846
you'll have to pass our rigorous tryouts.

09:15.930 --> 09:17.139
I met Na Baek-jin.

09:18.599 --> 09:19.850
The guy in the Union.

09:21.769 --> 09:22.603
What?

09:26.857 --> 09:28.651
Baek-jin, that fucking lunatic.

09:29.277 --> 09:30.194
Hey, well,

09:31.404 --> 09:32.613
did anything happen?

09:33.406 --> 09:34.574
Nothing happened.

09:36.409 --> 09:40.288
I don't care what you guys are doing
but leave me out of it.

09:42.290 --> 09:43.332
Si-eun.

09:44.041 --> 09:44.959
What's going on?

09:45.876 --> 09:48.087
I don't have as much free time as you.

09:48.170 --> 09:49.338
I have a lot to do.

09:50.131 --> 09:51.299
You guys have fun.

09:52.341 --> 09:54.051
What the hell is your problem?

09:55.052 --> 09:56.887
We didn't ask you to join us.

09:57.513 --> 09:58.347
That's right.

09:59.348 --> 10:01.142
So let's go our separate ways.

10:05.187 --> 10:06.022
Okay.

10:06.981 --> 10:08.482
I get what you're saying.

10:12.820 --> 10:13.654
Fine.

10:15.906 --> 10:17.491
Let's ignore each other.

10:21.954 --> 10:22.830
Good.

10:38.971 --> 10:39.805
Si-eun!

10:48.314 --> 10:50.691
Baku seemed like
he was doing that on purpose.

10:51.359 --> 10:52.568
And you too.

10:56.572 --> 10:59.367
I don't know what happened to you,

11:00.618 --> 11:02.828
but I bet Baku didn't mean what he said.

11:03.788 --> 11:05.331
Don't let it bother you.

11:07.958 --> 11:08.834
Jun-tae.

11:09.335 --> 11:10.169
Yes?

11:15.800 --> 11:16.634
It's just…

11:20.680 --> 11:22.223
I'm more comfortable alone.

11:37.655 --> 11:40.700
Now, that's it for transformers,

11:40.783 --> 11:43.786
which are a typical example
of mutual induction.

11:43.869 --> 11:45.746
Let's take a look at another example.

12:05.558 --> 12:06.475
Hang on.

12:08.102 --> 12:09.061
Hey, Eunjang.

12:14.275 --> 12:15.568
Where are your friends?

12:23.784 --> 12:26.954
Hey, didn't Baek-jin tell us
to leave this punk alone?

12:27.496 --> 12:28.372
He did?

12:29.999 --> 12:30.875
Let's just go.

12:36.964 --> 12:38.215
Hey, where's Seong-je?

12:38.799 --> 12:40.509
No idea. He'll be back soon.

12:52.938 --> 12:54.190
Jun-tae, where's Si-eun?

12:54.940 --> 12:56.901
He left right after class.

12:57.401 --> 12:58.235
He left?

13:00.654 --> 13:03.073
Man, what the heck is wrong with him?

13:04.575 --> 13:05.826
Did you talk to him?

13:07.077 --> 13:07.953
No.

13:09.038 --> 13:09.955
Well,

13:11.457 --> 13:13.876
I'm not sure, but I kind of have an idea.

13:15.294 --> 13:18.506
I mean, I don't think Si-eun meant
what he said either.

13:24.345 --> 13:26.222
I'll go ahead. See you tomorrow.

13:26.889 --> 13:27.765
Damn, man.

13:28.432 --> 13:30.601
Tell me you aren't meeting Baek-jin.

13:31.519 --> 13:32.895
Nothing like that, man.

13:33.395 --> 13:35.064
Take care. See you later.

13:37.358 --> 13:38.776
Then where are you going?

13:38.859 --> 13:41.070
On a date. Someone from Buil Girls' High.

13:57.461 --> 13:58.295
Let's go.

14:02.299 --> 14:03.509
Call Seong-je.

14:11.016 --> 14:12.309
Where could it be?

14:12.935 --> 14:15.187
I dropped my toy around here somewhere.

14:23.988 --> 14:25.072
It's been a while.

14:30.119 --> 14:31.245
How's your knee?

14:37.042 --> 14:39.044
Why did you come here?

14:39.128 --> 14:40.880
Hey, I don't see the newbie.

14:40.963 --> 14:42.089
Si-eun or whatever.

14:42.715 --> 14:44.425
Playing with him would be more fun.

14:44.508 --> 14:45.342
Is it fun

14:47.094 --> 14:48.637
to be Na Baek-jin's minion?

14:51.015 --> 14:51.849
It is fun.

14:53.142 --> 14:54.894
I get to kill punks like you.

15:00.357 --> 15:02.776
Are you fucking counting?
There are four of them.

15:05.154 --> 15:06.322
You're my playmate.

15:08.198 --> 15:09.867
What? Are you scared?

15:11.076 --> 15:12.119
Go, Jun-tae.

15:13.913 --> 15:14.914
What?

15:15.414 --> 15:16.874
I said go, idiot!

15:21.754 --> 15:23.339
You're so fucking cool.

15:24.173 --> 15:25.674
- You son of a bitch.
- Hey!

15:27.426 --> 15:29.762
- Hey, fuck you.
- Get back here, asshole!

15:31.013 --> 15:32.681
You guys are fucking ridiculous.

15:40.314 --> 15:41.523
This place is no good.

15:42.566 --> 15:43.859
Let's go somewhere quiet.

15:48.447 --> 15:49.865
Don't glare at me like that.

15:50.824 --> 15:51.992
You fucking wimp.

15:55.287 --> 15:56.455
You son of a bitch!

15:58.123 --> 15:58.958
Hey!

15:59.541 --> 16:01.085
Where are you going, asshole?

16:01.585 --> 16:02.419
Hey!

16:06.048 --> 16:07.549
You fucker! Get back here!

16:08.968 --> 16:10.010
Hey, you bastard!

16:10.636 --> 16:12.262
Man, that fucking asshole.

16:14.056 --> 16:14.890
Hey!

16:21.313 --> 16:22.481
- Go that way.
- Okay.

16:28.612 --> 16:29.446
Fuck.

16:30.864 --> 16:31.699
Hey, Seong-je.

16:32.992 --> 16:34.576
You need me to find one more?

16:35.494 --> 16:36.328
Yeon Si-eun?

16:37.955 --> 16:39.873
Man, I just let him go earlier.

16:40.624 --> 16:41.458
Yeah, got it.

16:52.052 --> 16:53.220
PARK HU-MIN

16:54.596 --> 16:56.932
This device is switched off. Please leave…

17:13.574 --> 17:16.076
SEO JUN-TAE
MISSED CALL

17:16.160 --> 17:20.456
SEO JUN-TAE:
ARE YOU ON YOUR WAY TO CRAM SCHOOL?

17:46.815 --> 17:47.733
Hello?

17:48.984 --> 17:49.902
Si-eun.

17:49.985 --> 17:51.195
What's that message about?

17:53.197 --> 17:55.991
I was just wondering
if you made it to cram school.

17:59.161 --> 18:00.954
Why are you asking?

18:04.875 --> 18:09.254
I just wanted to see if
you made it there safely.

18:10.756 --> 18:11.965
That's why I called.

18:13.383 --> 18:14.218
Yeah.

18:15.969 --> 18:18.764
- Hey!
- Si-eun, don't worry about me. I'm fine.

18:18.847 --> 18:20.557
- Go home after cram school.
- Hello?

18:21.058 --> 18:22.059
Seo Jun-tae?

18:22.142 --> 18:23.102
This asshole!

18:23.185 --> 18:25.646
- You son of a bitch!
- Man, fuck you.

18:25.729 --> 18:27.356
- Lift your head.
- Fucking bitch.

18:33.445 --> 18:34.822
You wear this all the time.

18:34.905 --> 18:37.658
It's my best outfit.
Now go get me some cigarettes.

18:37.741 --> 18:38.826
Hey, let's split it.

18:38.909 --> 18:39.868
Quit smoking.

18:39.952 --> 18:41.370
Hey, give me a smoke.

18:41.453 --> 18:42.371
I just quit.

18:42.913 --> 18:44.039
We're not open yet.

18:48.127 --> 18:49.378
Where's Baek-jin?

18:51.922 --> 18:52.798
Baek-jin?

18:53.841 --> 18:55.175
They're on first-name terms?

18:56.135 --> 18:58.095
You must be fucking crazy.

18:58.178 --> 18:59.346
- Seriously.
- Whatever.

18:59.429 --> 19:01.598
Hey, isn't that guy Park Hu-min?

19:02.516 --> 19:03.684
- Park Hu-min?
- Who?

19:04.184 --> 19:07.271
- I've heard that name.
- Eunjang's top dog. Don't you know him?

19:07.354 --> 19:09.273
- That's him?
- Keep playing cards.

19:09.356 --> 19:10.941
He's acting so fucking tough.

19:11.942 --> 19:13.235
Fuck!

19:19.950 --> 19:21.118
Na Baek-jin.

19:22.452 --> 19:23.412
Where is he?

19:31.461 --> 19:32.421
It's been a while.

19:56.570 --> 19:57.404
Park Hu-min.

19:59.448 --> 20:01.366
I still think of you as a friend.

20:07.414 --> 20:10.083
Joining the Union
is a good deal for you too.

20:11.543 --> 20:12.544
After graduation,

20:13.837 --> 20:16.089
it'll become a regular business.

20:17.424 --> 20:18.759
It's all planned out.

20:27.726 --> 20:30.270
You're actually a fucking dumbass.

20:37.486 --> 20:38.320
Hey.

20:39.947 --> 20:41.073
Fucking moron.

20:44.743 --> 20:48.080
Do you still not know
why I don't do your thug stuff?

20:50.624 --> 20:52.417
Or do you pretend not to know?

20:57.339 --> 20:58.215
I just…

21:01.802 --> 21:03.345
really fucking hate you.

21:15.524 --> 21:17.693
I think you're the dumbass, not me.

21:22.281 --> 21:24.366
What the fuck did you do?

21:27.411 --> 21:28.829
How's Go Hyun-tak doing?

21:49.891 --> 21:50.726
Hey.

21:54.813 --> 21:56.398
Did Baek-jin say you can leave?

21:57.441 --> 21:58.483
I doubt that.

21:59.568 --> 22:01.153
I don't have time for this.

22:02.571 --> 22:03.780
Let's make it short.

22:20.172 --> 22:21.089
Son of a bitch!

22:33.643 --> 22:35.687
Your punches are still as weak as ever.

22:39.775 --> 22:40.776
You fucking…

22:56.875 --> 22:58.293
Hey, we're not done yet.

22:59.378 --> 23:00.921
Get up, you fucking idiot.

23:03.965 --> 23:05.550
Fucking shit.

23:07.594 --> 23:08.553
Fuck you.

23:08.637 --> 23:09.471
Come on.

23:12.265 --> 23:13.100
Fuck you!

23:19.147 --> 23:19.981
Want some more?

23:20.065 --> 23:21.358
Fuck! Kill him!

23:21.441 --> 23:22.401
Shit!

23:24.653 --> 23:25.862
Hey! Fuck you!

23:27.989 --> 23:28.824
Fuck!

23:30.534 --> 23:32.160
Hey, you son of a bitch!

23:37.249 --> 23:38.333
Fuck you!

23:42.504 --> 23:44.506
Fucking son of a bitch.

23:46.550 --> 23:47.801
Can I leave now?

23:53.432 --> 23:54.266
That's enough.

24:02.524 --> 24:03.984
That's enough. He can leave.

24:06.611 --> 24:09.114
Go see for yourself
to understand the situation.

24:10.198 --> 24:12.159
How long can you hold out like this?

24:17.080 --> 24:17.914
Hey.

24:20.459 --> 24:22.294
You're not letting me go.

24:24.838 --> 24:26.465
I'm leaving for your sake.

24:28.758 --> 24:30.343
Everyone here almost died.

24:45.567 --> 24:46.568
Fuck!

24:54.659 --> 24:57.537
Hey, I heard Hyun-tak went
to fight Seong-je.

24:57.621 --> 25:00.957
Fuck. Hyun-tak is dead.
Seong-je is a fucking psycho.

25:01.041 --> 25:03.585
- Want to go watch? I got the address.
- Are you crazy?

25:03.668 --> 25:04.503
Hey.

25:19.518 --> 25:20.560
Stop it!

25:21.561 --> 25:23.104
What the fuck are you doing?

25:23.188 --> 25:25.023
Hey, isn't this guy fucking cute?

25:25.106 --> 25:26.525
- Look at this guy.
- Don't do it!

25:27.025 --> 25:28.360
- Fucking asshole.
- Stop it!

25:29.194 --> 25:30.362
Stop it!

25:32.364 --> 25:33.698
Man, fuck this.

25:41.540 --> 25:43.250
Hey, you fucker!

25:57.973 --> 25:58.807
Glasses.

26:00.600 --> 26:01.977
Are you okay, Hyun-tak?

26:06.147 --> 26:08.775
Now, time for a photo. Look over here.

26:10.902 --> 26:13.947
One, two, three. For fuck's sake. Hey.

26:15.323 --> 26:16.616
I said look here.

26:19.286 --> 26:20.745
What's this? You sad?

26:21.705 --> 26:23.290
Should I beat him some more?

26:25.000 --> 26:26.334
Let's get this over with.

26:27.294 --> 26:30.964
Now, smile big.
One, two, three. Say cheese!

26:48.523 --> 26:49.357
Newbie!

26:54.279 --> 26:55.530
I've missed you.

27:01.202 --> 27:02.495
Today's been fun!

27:03.038 --> 27:04.539
Is it my birthday or what?

27:05.123 --> 27:06.833
Should I buy a lottery ticket too?

27:17.761 --> 27:20.513
Whoa. You were going to stab me with this?

27:37.656 --> 27:39.032
You're a fucking wimp.

27:41.159 --> 27:42.327
This is no damn fun.

27:46.790 --> 27:47.791
Fuck you.

28:36.089 --> 28:36.923
Fuck you!

28:42.053 --> 28:42.929
Let go!

29:08.329 --> 29:09.247
That's it!

30:07.972 --> 30:09.474
Fuck you!

30:10.975 --> 30:12.310
Let me go, you fucker!

30:23.279 --> 30:24.572
Fuck you, asshole!

30:50.139 --> 30:52.392
You fucking moron. Fuck you.

30:54.102 --> 30:55.770
Get up, you fucking bastard.

30:56.938 --> 30:57.814
Fuck you.

31:13.913 --> 31:15.081
So I have to

31:15.999 --> 31:17.917
kill you to end this, don't I?

32:18.102 --> 32:20.271
Hey, Si-eun! Are you okay?

32:20.355 --> 32:21.230
Hey, Si-eun!

32:28.988 --> 32:30.156
Su-ho.

32:33.284 --> 32:34.869
I got into another fight.

32:40.667 --> 32:41.542
I'm sorry.

36:46.245 --> 36:50.166
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
